ack</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-with-strong-fundamentals?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-with-strong-fundamentals?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p>The winning stocks were: ⬇️</p>",
